{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1000_p", "source_sha256": "efbc73eab6b79189ec205ae363780a5af68e09f2c53ec64e13c505bc152fd029", "ja": "（そろそろ、次の公演の打ち合わせをしないとな。\nええと、環は……あ、いたいた）", "zh": "（差不多该讨论下次公演了。\n呃，环在哪……啊，找到了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1ecd9423d68f9aa9d7c675995e530492106a55290b920d683e51d87877b3f690", "ja": "お疲れさま、環、響、海美。\nなんだか楽しそうだけど、遊びの相談か？", "zh": "辛苦了，环、响、海美。\n你们看起来好开心，是在讨论要出去玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "6f02b603198c05490523346dfb7598ecf36a41a7bc0b223541e411d354b09952", "ja": "ううん！　ちがうよ、おやぶん！", "zh": "不是！不对喔，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a39cc0eae8f736f602317fd5ac43e00f313d86f220bdf7b34f00445483488472", "ja": "あれ、違ったのか？　みんなで虫とりに行くって\n聞こえたような気がしたんだけど……。", "zh": "咦，不对吗？\n我好像有听到你们说要大家一起去捕虫啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "c51ed10c99202755b62665ce98ab9a76f51b34d453f5e442f8472db1d01851e8", "ja": "{$P$}、\n虫とりは遊びじゃないんだぞ！", "zh": "{$P$}，捕虫可不是出去玩喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "e80b2fe8f48faa9143fca1bd0e2e1fe9d14c0b115ff0d17386f9e4ca1902a9c5", "ja": "そうそう！\n{$P$}、遊びじゃないよっ！", "zh": "没错没错！\n{$P$}，这可不是出去玩呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1006_p", "source_sha256": "18739513677619ec2554e37aa0e121075685cae7f0459b1c711df4f06837077e", "ja": "そ、そうか。なんか、ごめんな？", "zh": "这、这样啊。好像冒犯到了，抱歉哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "74cc73109c504e27dbce01b01e98293923b7094609dd4b174a7e0e54ec4de3c2", "ja": "あのね、たまき、かおりにいつも歌を\n教えてもらってるから、プレゼントしようと思って。", "zh": "那个呀，因为歌织时常教环怎么唱歌，\n所以环想送礼给她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "c3380a891cb728cb1f3824a835d8ce73fd822a7e590ecd0475a9319bf9fc8f95", "ja": "超かっこいい虫をプレゼントするぞ～！\nくふふっ♪", "zh": "环要送歌织超帅气的昆虫当礼物喔～！\n呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8f41c82e77edb1bd973fc9b50973f76fe4e5e5e099375988aac2f851bcdcd1ef", "ja": "虫……。", "zh": "昆虫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "e5a29c58aca6016b62051b9bdc7ed819780b78d48226feb85e106193e8ceae4b", "ja": "ねーねー、おやぶんは、どんな虫がいいと思う？\nどんな虫だったら、かおりにぴったりかな？", "zh": "欸～欸～老大觉得，送什么样的昆虫才好呢？\n哪种昆虫会适合歌织呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c7da20cee92e6f587462f51eca75cfbda0e7609b1c6b9c83f0e9c748d9f532de", "ja": "歌織さんに似合う虫……虫かぁ……。\nそうだな……。", "zh": "适合歌织小姐的昆虫……昆虫吗……\n这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "f07b0e572d6cf158e57e9f78b7bd5df19808921c5419798dbc983602074495ff", "ja": "かおにゃんに似合うのは、やっぱキラキラしてる\n虫でしょ！　……あ、タマムシとか！？", "zh": "应该还是闪闪发光的昆虫才适合歌织喵吧！\n……啊，像吉丁虫之类的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "6ac0fbc67219184685a4d2e391fd0a72d601d57763ff0153ccc65d25ce340f2e", "ja": "えーっ、そうかなぁ？　もらってうれしい虫といえば、\n大きくてかっこいいやつでしょ？", "zh": "咦～是吗？如果要说收到什么昆虫会开心，\n那当然是又大又帅气的那种吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "b6691d1c7ee1f6cb3b04d0825c835b623dd7fbfdfef3048aae13f552f23575a2", "ja": "ここはトンボの王様、オニヤンマで決まりさー！", "zh": "就决定送歌织蜻蜓界的巨无霸，无霸勾蜓啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "6e355d0f1781d77466c8f54ef2ebec4dc1e55fca67a02c1ce0a94b1c3a0d0810", "ja": "ねえねえ、おやぶんは？\nおやぶんだったら、どんな虫がほしい？", "zh": "欸欸，老大呢？\n老大的话，想要怎样的昆虫？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1016_p", "source_sha256": "15446c1df080a5602075cc1b967453ad0b216d01d9cfaeb391cd188e6a4cb8ea", "ja": "俺か？　うーん、カブトムシとか、\nオオクワガタとかかな……？", "zh": "我吗？唔～比方说独角仙、\n或是日本大锹形虫之类的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "2c5e1a0f6f6ab5777a2faafccccd2fb0268986d4b495afab0c7f44af98ff08ed", "ja": "へーっ、そうなんだ！？\n{$P$}は、強そうな虫が好きなの？", "zh": "哦～是喔！？\n原来{$P$}喜欢看起来很强大的虫吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "71337652fa68b94d06fab3592420809820129b04595a47236b8ef0428fb61a07", "ja": "なんか、ブナンすぎて面白くないぞ、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "总觉得太平淡无奇了，很没意思喔，\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1019_p", "source_sha256": "083f3e3b12837e3fee4e90733630a296e0185bb34347ba31e565dc97504501cf", "ja": "いや、意外性を狙っても……。\nというか、今は虫の話をしに来たんじゃないんだ。", "zh": "不，就算刻意要你们大感意外也……\n话说，我刚才可不是为了谈论昆虫而来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "9b7b11ff18c64fd0323379d3b8cc676995addcd16edf974fad36645ec1f59fda", "ja": "あれ？　それじゃ{$P$}、\n何しに来たの？", "zh": "咦？那{$P$}是为了什么事过来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1021_p", "source_sha256": "daf93e994447a996d6f051b8bbb296ab006c1bb546704c99efe88a096f0aced5", "ja": "うん、環にちょっと話があってな。\n環に夢中になってほしいのは、虫とりじゃなくて……。", "zh": "嗯，我有件事想找环谈谈。\n我希望环热衷到忘我的不是捕虫，而是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1022_p", "source_sha256": "5b7248e2c3d3b5aadfbe38282fb0d6dcbf100f890a8f33c1572b0f0f3e49d192", "ja": "今度の公演で、センターをやってみないか？", "zh": "下次的公演，你要不要尝试担任Center？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "460dae9e7fe1969cb5c814bf0a20e1abefcaa702dbf171d22b9183a563c626de", "ja": "えっ！？　センターって、センター？\n……今度は、たまきの番なの！？", "zh": "咦！？Center，是舞台上的Center吗？\n……这次轮到环来当了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1024_p", "source_sha256": "e73bea6cfe00da6e2d157a65dd76a613f27863aeec050c42ea8579d930543ef8", "ja": "ああ、そうだ。どうだ、やってくれるか？\nきっと虫とりより面白いぞ！", "zh": "是的，没有错。怎么样？你愿意担任吗？\n肯定比捕虫更好玩喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "998fb0f9d95b822ee411f2e4520ca2ee70657fe8f9ede40eb6977a9fa84b0726", "ja": "うん、やる！　わーい！\nたまき、センターやりたかったんだ～！", "zh": "嗯，环要当！哇～！\n环从之前就好想担任Center了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1026_013hib", "source_sha256": "a983503ae51e481cb69fab081cb7a0ddc40fb96a164678537a14dd46b261a3c7", "ja": "良かったね、環！\nよし、自分も一緒にレッスンするぞ！", "zh": "真是太好了，环！\n好，本人也会陪你一起训练喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "d23716b077e100d8fce34a937fb955c44556a6a4f11f870d5fbccf06c6768371", "ja": "私も私もっ！　響、私も手伝いたいーっ☆\nいいよね、環！", "zh": "我也是、我也是！响，我也想帮忙～☆\n可以吧？环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "f82fcb79d96ae64e125ef355ddf1f0ebeb2ff205c9c8e6a5a94898638d47ba76", "ja": "うん！　ふたりとも、いっしょにレッスンしよー！\nいいよね？　おやぶん！", "zh": "嗯！你们两个也一起来练习吧～！\n这样可以吧？老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1029_p", "source_sha256": "0d87a7e5a4f34a239b53edba0941d0e2e627f559bdc5c6c7013256fa5250bb1e", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ。\n響、海美、ふたりもよろしくな！", "zh": "嗯，那当然。\n响、海美，也麻烦你们两位了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1030_013hib", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "59e9e21f5f41b885357e452a8dd5672c5b666e74416729b9070a2996b949f2db", "ja": "えへへ、センターかぁ……\nがんばるぞ～、くふふっ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，Center啊……\n环要加油啰～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_033_1033_p", "source_sha256": "cd8ddfb6c01f680b92af893bae2b34abf1a52d880dbba362622489154b8bb76a", "ja": "（環、かなりやる気みたいだな。次の公演は、\n驚くようなものが見れるかもしれないぞ！)", "zh": "（环看着很有干劲，下次的公演，\n说不定可以看到她令人惊艳的表现喔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
